MODE C — FULL HARDWARE (robot on the beach)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Requires: Raspberry Pi 5, ESP32 on /dev/ttyUSB0, USB camera, IMU, GPS

  ros2 launch robot_bringup beach_robot.launch.py

  Override model or log path:
  ros2 launch robot_bringup beach_robot.launch.py \
    model_path:=/home/ttkan/AutonomousBeachRobot/ml/models/trash_v3_best.onnx \
    fsm_log_path:=/home/ttkan/run_logs/mission_$(date +%Y%m%d_%H%M%S).csv

  Arm:
    ros2 topic pub --once /mission_control/command std_msgs/msg/String "data: START"

  Emergency stop:
    ros2 topic pub --once /mission_control/command std_msgs/msg/String "data: STOP"


