═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
MONITORING — USEFUL TOPIC ECHOES
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  FSM state transitions:
    ros2 topic echo /mission_control/state

  What the FSM is commanding:
    ros2 topic echo /cmd_vel

  Detections coming out of trash_detector:
    ros2 topic echo /trash_detections

  Terrain safety events (should be silent in sim/indoor modes):
    ros2 topic echo /terrain_events

  Battery voltage:
    ros2 topic echo /battery_voltage

  GPS fix:
    ros2 topic echo /fix

  List all active topics:
    ros2 topic list


═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
FSM STATE REFERENCE
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  CALIBRATE  Hold still 1.5s — IMU locks variance baseline
  SCAN       Rotate at 0.3 rad/s — waiting for detection conf ≥ 0.45
  TRACK      Visual servo toward target — approach at 0.2 m/s
  PICKUP     Log GPS+conf to CSV, reset tracker, return to SCAN
  STUCK      No odometry movement for 5s — reverse 1.5s, rotate 45°, resume
  LOW_BATTERY  Voltage < 10.5V — full stop, await operator

  norm_area threshold for SCAN→TRACK: conf ≥ 0.45
  norm_area threshold for TRACK→PICKUP: bbox_px / (640×480) ≥ 0.15
    → area ≈ 46080 px² at 640×480


═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
PARAMETER OVERRIDES (beach_robot.launch.py args)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  sim_mode              true/false   Disables STUCK watchdog + TRACK timeout
  disable_imu_safety    true/false   Mutes STOP_IMU events
  disable_camera_safety true/false   Mutes STOP_CAM events
  model_path            string       Absolute path to .onnx model file
  fsm_log_path          string       CSV path for PICKUP event log
